    },
    {
        "id": 326,
        "character": "Dr. Glitchwell",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "content": "BMP images store each pixel within the RGBA model (Red, Green, Blue, Alpha)."
    },
    {
        "id": 327,
        "character": "Dr. Glitchwell",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "content": "Alpha is the opacity value. All RGBA values will be combined into one colour pixel."
    },
    {
        "id": 328,
        "character": "Dr. Glitchwell",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "content": "Is this relevant for steganography?",
        "next": 320
